       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-HAPTIC-FORCE.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-HAPTIC-FORCE-PROOFS.
           05  WS-FORCE-FIDELITY-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GOD-OBJECT-OK            PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PASSIVITY-CTRL-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-HAPTIC-LATENCY-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-HAPTIC-FORCE-SEAL-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-HAPTIC-FORCE-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-HAP-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-HAP-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-FORCE-AND-GODOBJ.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-PASSIVITY-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-HAP-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-FORCE-AND-GODOBJ.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-FORCE-FIDELITY-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GOD-OBJECT-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-PASSIVITY-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PASSIVITY-CTRL-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-HAPTIC-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-HAP-PROOFS.
           IF WS-FORCE-FIDELITY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-GOD-OBJECT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-PASSIVITY-CTRL-OK = 1 AND
              WS-HAPTIC-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-HAPTIC-FORCE-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-HAP-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-HAP-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-HAP-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-HAP-CODE.
